{
  "id": "PRO.25",
  "number": "25",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Prov. 25",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "ms1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "More Proverbs of Solomon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are more proverbs of Solomon, compiled by the men of Hezekiah king of Judah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is the glory of God to conceal a matter;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to search out a matter is the glory of kings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the heavens are high and the earth is deep,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so the hearts of kings are unsearchable.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remove the dross from the silver,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and a silversmith can produce a vessel;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "remove wicked officials from the king's presence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and his throne will be established through righteousness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not exalt yourself in the king's presence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and do not claim a place among his great men;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "it is better for him to say to you, \"Come up here,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "than for him to humiliate you before his nobles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "PRO 25:7"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PRO 25:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "What you have seen with your eyes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do not bring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "hastily to court,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PRO 25:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for what will you do in the end",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "if your neighbor puts you to shame?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you take your neighbor to court,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "do not betray another's confidence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or the one who hears it may shame you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the charge against you will stand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like apples",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of gold in settings of silver",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "is a ruling rightly given.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like an earring of gold or an ornament of fine gold",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "is the rebuke of a wise judge to a listening ear.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like a snow-cooled drink at harvest time",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "is a trustworthy messenger to the one who sends him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he refreshes the spirit of his master.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like clouds and wind without rain",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "is one who boasts of gifts never given.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Through patience a ruler can be persuaded,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and a gentle tongue can break a bone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you find honey, eat just enough—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "too much of it, and you will vomit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seldom set foot in your neighbor's house—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 25:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "too much of you, and they will hate you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like a club or a sword or a sharp arrow",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
